        "number": 61260,
        "title": "Bluetooth: Host: Disconnected bonds affect `_bt_gatt_ccc.value`",
        "body": "The documentation on `_bt_gatt_ccc.value` specifies that only connected peers contribute to that value. But if `CONFIG_BT_SETTINGS_CCC_LAZY_LOADING=n`, the implementation summarizes over all stores CCC values, including (bonded) disconnected peers.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/blob/5c7c099891fd06284b32baa12c6de04a30d3b127/subsys/bluetooth/host/gatt.c#L2125-L2129\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nOnly connected peers should be included in the summarized value.",
